# Treesitter parsers and queries are no longer stored here at all —
# nvim-treesitter installs both into stdpath('data')/site
# (~/.local/share/nvim/site), outside this repo. Nothing to ignore, and nothing
# to commit: `:TSUpdate` reproduces them from the plugin's pinned manifest.

# NOT ignored, on purpose:
#   nvim-pack-lock.json vim.pack's lockfile. `:h vim.pack-lockfile` says to
#                       "treat lockfile like its part [of the config]: put
#                       under version control" — with it committed, a new
#                       machine installs every plugin at the exact revision
#                       this one has.

# Neovim writes these into the config dir in some workflows.
spell/
.netrwhist
